      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/lorkenpeist/{size}/1959_2.png",
      "created_at": "2019-03-19T22:22:52.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I can't imagine that would work out very well, as you'd basically just stall out the invaders until they deplete the invader deck and you lose.&nbsp; It's okay for blight removal to be a thing a spirit does (Keeper, Green, and Earth all start with ways to remove blight), but as a core concept you just wouldn't have a way to close out the game.</p>",
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:59:49.389Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
