      "created_at": "2019-03-19T22:37:33.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Sure, but I thought spirits were always designed under the assumption they would be played with other spirits. I guess I was thinking of a wildfire, plague, blight cleaning spirit combo.Or swap one of those first 2 with the trickster. That was, you could expeirment with letting places blight, so that other spirits could take advantage of that, followed by the blight cleaning spirit cleaning some of that blight back up.&nbsp;</p>",
