      "id": 226040,
      "name": "MindWanderer",
      "username": "MindWanderer",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mindwanderer/{size}/4816_2.png",
      "created_at": "2019-03-19T22:49:43.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Each spirit is designed to be viable in solo play, so there will never be one that absolutely requires support from another.&nbsp; Some are hard to play solo (Ocean, BODAN), but not impossible.&nbsp; That said, there could certainly be a spirit&nbsp;that clean up/prevent blight as an alternate approach to defense, as long as they can also generate fear somehow.</p>",
      "post_number": 4,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:59:49.506Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
